cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the accompanying manuscript."
title: "Myeloid differentiation trajectories shape response to combined immuno-chemotherapy across multiple solid tumors"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a pan-cancer tumor-infiltrating myeloid (TIM) atlas of
  four solid malignancies (NSCLC, TNBC, PC, ESCC), including TIM subclustering,
  cell-cell communication (CellChat), pseudotime trajectory (monocle3),
  co-expression networks (hdWGCNA) and statistical modelling of clinical
  response.
type: software
